# Club & Grub - Feast Land B co-op: "Tower of Treats" for two (designer DB1; docs/expansion/DESIGN.md D.9, GAMEPLAY.md
# 13.9.8). The co-op file of levels/bonus_b.lvl (kind = coop, coop_of, coop_base_hash; never edit the solo file): the
# bonus stage of 2-1 (Echo Caverns) entered through the warp of w2_l1_coop. A Feast Land in co-op has the team rules
# only - no x2 gate (DESIGN.md D.8 #1): the same cake tower, springs, icing stairs and elevator (room on it for two);
# P2 starts a cell behind P1; giant roasts and Relay Bounce follow GAMEPLAY.md 13.9.8. The spiral staff on the crown
# ends the stage (and its source level) for the tribe.

[meta]
format = 2
id = bonus_b_coop
name = "Feast Land B"
kind = coop
coop_of = bonus_b
coop_base_hash = "c6ed5b0c95847f70422e622a4600f674dd1c71f8833a2f11b4072a03c42689ff"
book = 1
order = 0
world = 0
stage = 0
biome = feast
terrain_a = feast/terrain_icing
terrain_b = feast/terrain_biscuit
background = feast
music = bonus
bonus_tier = 1
author = DB1
notes = "Co-op Feast Land B (bonus of 2-1), team rules only. 45-90 s. Entered through the warp of w2_l1_coop."

[legend]
? = objects/hidden_spot kind=small count=3 contents=food:15,food:16,food:17 look=inset tile=%
